@token = PASTE_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE

### Create two savings accounts
POST http://localhost:8080/api/savings/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"accountName":"Emergency Fund","targetAmount":20000.00}

###
POST http://localhost:8080/api/savings/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"accountName":"Vacation"}

### Deposit R1500 into account 1 (use your real account ids)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/savings/deposit
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"accountId":1,"amount":1500.00,"description":"October top-up"}

### Withdraw more than the balance -> 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/savings/withdraw
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"accountId":1,"amount":99999.00}

### Transfer R500 from account 1 to account 2
POST http://localhost:8080/api/savings/transfer
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"fromAccountId":1,"toAccountId":2,"amount":500.00}

### History (all accounts, or add ?accountId=1)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/savings/history
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create a goal
POST http://localhost:8080/api/goals
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"New laptop","targetAmount":12000.00,"deadline":"2027-03-31"}

### Contribute R5000
POST http://localhost:8080/api/goals/1/contribute
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"amount":5000.00}

### Contribute R7000 -> reaches target, status COMPLETED, GOAL_ACHIEVED notification
POST http://localhost:8080/api/goals/1/contribute
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"amount":7000.00}

###
GET http://localhost:8080/api/notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
